#: cddbdlg.cpp:137
msgid ""
"The artist name of the disc has to be entered.\n"
"Please correct the entry and try again."
msgstr ""
"Debe introducir lo nome do artista.\n"
"Por favor corrixa a entrada e ténteo de novo."

